# Local scratch/probe scripts and generated artifact lists.
# The ROOT .scratch/ holds tracked research notes the operator wants kept in
# git ("save research markdowns always"), so re-include it after the broad
# ignore — without the negation, new root research notes are silently dropped.
**/.scratch/
!/.scratch/
!/.scratch/**

# Xcode/SwiftPM user-specific and generated workspace files
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
